  C --> L[Authorized Compliance Lookup]
  H -- Yes --> L
  L --> M[Provider Mapping]
  M --> R[Deterministic Rules]
  R --> S[Compliance Status]
  S --> A[Audit Event]
  S --> UI[Mobile Result / Alert]
